# elixir-mcp local configuration. Copy to .env (mode 0600) and fill in.
# .env is gitignored; NEVER commit real values — this repo is public.

# --- CR API checks (maintainer machine only; never CI, never cloud) ---
# A Clash Royale API token, IP-bound to this machine (canonical var name),
# read by `npm run cr` (infra/scripts/cr-api.mjs) to check a claim against
# the live API. Collectors do NOT use this file: a collector runs from the
# elixir-mcp-collector release with its own .env beside the binary, holding
# the operator's own CR key and the one-time bearer token Elixir issues
# (ELIXIR_API_TOKEN). No AWS credentials, no queue names:
# https://elixir.poapkings.com/docs/operators
CR_API_TOKEN=

# --- local dev ---
#DATABASE_URL=postgres://otto@localhost:5432/elixir_mcp_dev
#ELIXIR_MCP_OWNER_EMAIL=
